  "details": "1. Open VRChat on PC.\n\n2. Go to The Black Cat (where this bug was discovered).\n\n3. [PC] Equip an Avatar that has either those options in the Expression Menu. Must be a Synced float Parameter used on the Puppet (PC-only Avatars work too).\n\n4. Two players on opposite platforms must do the following:\n\n- [PC] Open a Two Axis, Four Axis, or Radial Puppet in the Expression Menu.\n\n- [Quest] Look at the user on PC who is opening it.\n\nThe user on Standalone Quest should notice a significant amount of frame drops. They will continue to have their frames dropped until the PC user closes their Puppet.",
